This file gathers and re-exports the canonical midpoint split of a U-neighbourhood: the one-sided clip maps on presented intervals, primitive recursiveness of the clip codes, decoding of a clipped pair and of a singleton list code, membership and presented intervals for the clipped lists, the first element and the midpoint, primitive recursiveness of the two halves, the endpoint comparisons with the midpoint, the two realizations of the halves, and disjointness, covering, and properness.
